{"total_count":3,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7816","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7816/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7816/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7816/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7816","id":6275874745,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNtuflA","number":7816,"title":"fix(fleet): repair two main build breaks (FLEET_REPOS size, atlas schema fileset)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-08T21:33:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T21:34:50Z","closed_at":"2026-11-08T21:33:53Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7816","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7816","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7816.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7816.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-08T21:33:53Z"},"body":"Two independent breaks in the fleet package build on main, both found while building the amd toplevel (every NixOS build from current main fails):\n\n1. **fleet-queue E0308** — c512bc31df (#5595) changed `FLEET_REPOS: [&str; 9]` to `[&str; 10]` while only editing the comment above it; no entry was added (both `dezren39/nix` and `dezren39/darwin-nix` were already listed). Fix: size back to 9, matching the actual 9-entry allowlist.\n2. **atlas-core missing .sql** — since the search serve role landed (#5604), the fleet build compiles atlas-core, whose `stage.rs` `include_str!`s `../../../schema/atlas_stage_v1.sql` and `stage_registry_v1.sql`. The `fleetSrc` fileset in `pkgs/fleet/default.nix` did not include `../atlas-search/schema`, so the build died with \"No such file or directory\". Fix: add the schema dir to the fileset union.\n\nVerification (on amd, this branch): `nix build .#fleet` — exit 0, `/nix/store/cs0bif2700vjw4rbcn92aqfcmyvy4jpq-fleet-0.1.0`. Before the fixes it failed first at break 1, then at break 2.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796765622&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7816&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7816&signature=fd140f3db0845ef68b8a5dd0b254a16558c1a0c8b31d819913dfc5d576c4472e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7816?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7816/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7816/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7822","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7822/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7822/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7822/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7822","id":6276155347,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNt8a1w","number":7822,"title":"fix(id): remove duplicated fields in ChainExt test literal (main build break)","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-08T22:05:23Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T22:10:41Z","closed_at":"2026-11-08T22:10:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7822","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7822","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7822.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7822.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-08T22:10:38Z"},"body":"Third break found while building the amd toplevel from main (after #7816): the `id` package check phase fails with error[E0062] x4 — the `ChainExt` literal in `test_a_header_breaking_the_sequence_rule_is_refused_at_ingest` (`pkgs/id/tests/event_store_properties.rs`) listed `after`/`tag`/`document`/`removes` twice, where a merge spliced the pre-chat field list together with the post-chat one.\n\n`ChainExt` (`pkgs/id/src/chain.rs`) has exactly 11 fields: kind, group, after, tag, document, removes, note, link, checkpoint, rotation, chat. The fixed literal names each once, matching the good literals in the same file. No production code touched.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796767526&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7822&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7822&signature=e3a4027ab00baaff68b20d9d29e3b4c140865b1189e9a3d0fc99be583671d380\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7822?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7822/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7822/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7817","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7817/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7817/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7817/events","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7817","id":6275881718,"node_id":"PR_kwDOJWP4788AAAABNtu17g","number":7817,"title":"feat(amd): wvkbd on-screen keyboard, tied to Sunshine streams","user":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-11-08T21:34:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T03:14:31Z","closed_at":"2026-11-08T23:26:21Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/pulls/7817","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7817","diff_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7817.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/pull/7817.patch","merged_at":"2026-11-08T23:26:21Z"},"body":"Drew streams the laptop desktop to his phone via Sunshine/Moonlight and asked for a permanent on-screen keyboard that runs ONLY while he is connected via Sunshine — not at plain desktop login (his steering; an unconditional Hyprland autostart was in the first cut and was removed before this PR).\n\nChanges:\n- `home/common/default.nix`: install `pkgs.wvkbd` in home.packages.\n- `nixos/hosts/amd-sunshine.nix`: wire Sunshine `global_prep_cmd` (key verified present in the pinned Sunshine binary, 2026.914.233613; the module renders the JSON string verbatim into sunshine.conf via its keyValue format) to two scripts:\n  - `sunshine-wvkbd-start` at stream start: pgrep guard, then `setsid -f wvkbd-mobintl -L 500` (detached, returns immediately — Sunshine waits for prep commands to exit before streaming).\n  - `sunshine-wvkbd-stop` at stream stop: `pkill -x wvkbd-mobintl`.\n- `config/hypr/hyprland.lua`: SUPER+SHIFT+O re-shows the keyboard (SIGUSR2; launches it if not running). SUPER+SHIFT+K was already taken by a workspace-move bind, hence O.\n\nVerification: full `nixosConfigurations.amd` toplevel builds on amd from this branch (after #7816 repaired the fleet package build, which was broken on main and blocked any toplevel build). Post-merge: switch + live checks (profile path, generated sunshine.conf, prep do/undo simulation, Sunshine/opencode services).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796765668&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7817&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7817&signature=0805f9923c1c818b755282d0ed1b35a51e73a7789bb50fafe564283cfc168ee7\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7817?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7817/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/7817/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}